ind":"announcement","title":"#ShotOnLuna: Show Us Your Best MAFATE Moment","summary":"We want to see the world through your eyes during Steam Next Fest and the new MAFATE demo! Play the demo, snap your favourite moment, and share it for a chance to win a full copy of MAFATE at launch.How It WorksPlay the MAFATE demo.Capture a screenshot or in-game photo of a moment you love.Post it either in the Steam Community or across our social media channels with #ShotOnLuna, a one-line caption on why it's your favourite moment - be sure to include your Steam ID.Wait for the team to pick the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691293","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3133220-1846651706690648","game_id":"steam-3133220","kind":"announcement","title":"Streams All Week During NextFest","summary":"Join us in streams all throughout the week to explore the beautiful Cirque de Mafate. We are so excited for you to enjoy MAFATE and hope your adventure with Elios & Luna (and of course, the bibiis) is delightful. This new demo comes with oodles of new features and content","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T15:01:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690648","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3133220-1846651706682159","game_id":"steam-3133220","kind":"announcement","title":"Play the new MAFATE demo as part of Steam Next Fest!","summary":"We are thrilled to announce MAFATE as part of the upcoming Steam Next Fest! And with this news, we are also delighted to announce that a brand-new version of the demo is available to play RIGHT NOW. 🎉This new demo comes with oodles of new features and content","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T16:08:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706682159","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3133220-1846018067943507","game_id":"steam-3133220","kind":"announcement","title":"MAFATE x Birds of Play","summary":"Join us for the 🦅 Birds of Play Steam Event!Help us celebrate Réunion and the Cirque de Mafate with the birds that call it home. From the elusive Papang to the fierce little Zoiseau la Vierge and the treetop-singing Bulbul de Bourbon, we're highlighting the real species behind the world you explore.Special thanks to NEON AURELIUS and their upcoming title Sparrow Warfare for making this possible!Once you've played the demo, come back here and let us know in the comments which bird was your favour","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T09:42:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067943507","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3133220-1842846814440608","game_id":"steam-3133220","kind":"announcement","title":"P3K: Clovis’ Invention","summary":"Deep in the heart of Mafate, getting a letter all the way to Saint-Denis isn’t exactly what you’d call a simple task.Fortunately, Elios can count on a rather unusual ally. His name is P3K. More commonly known to the local residents as Papang 3000.And contrary to what its name might suggest, P3K isn’t exactly a high-tech machine designed to conquer the world. It’s mostly an invention by Clovis. And he’d really like you to know that.A Machine Like No OtherP3K was designed to maintain the connectio","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-02T15:00:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814440608","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3133220-1842212951300679","game_id":"steam-3133220","kind":"announcement","title":"Luna: Much More Than a Camera","summary":"Becoming a camera was certainly not part of Luna’s plans.But now that she has to deal with this new form, she might as well make the most of it.And in MAFATE, a camera can do much more than just take pictures. Discovering Réunion Through a LensFor Luna, everything is new.She comes from mainland France and had never discovered Réunion, its landscapes, its people, or its stories.Her camera becomes her first way of exploring this unknown island.Every encounter, every creature, and every landscape c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-27T16:32:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951300679","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3133220-1841579228662888","game_id":"steam-3133220","kind":"announcement","title":"RESEARCH No. 012 — THE BIBIIS","summary":"Researcher: Clara Status: Research ongoing Subject: Bibii behavior in response to disturbances in the vital flowThe data collected during recent observations now reveals several correlations between the disruption of the island’s vital flow and the current condition of the Bibiis. RESEARCH OBSERVATION No. 045 — INITIAL OBSERVATION The Bibiis have always been present on the island.They are, however, known for their ability to remain beyond our sight. Their natural behavior, habitat, and habits ap","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-19T15:00:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228662888","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3133220-1840944183774215","game_id":"steam-3133220","kind":"announcement","title":"Elios: Following in the Footsteps of Mafate’s Mail Carrier","summary":"In MAFATE, you play as Elios, a young mail carrier who travels the trails of the cirque to deliver letters to its inhabitants.But before becoming a video game character, the mail carrier of Mafate was a very real figure, deeply connected to the history of the cirque. A Story That Inspired UsIn Mafate, delivering the mail has long meant traveling the trails on foot, sometimes for hours, to reach the different settlements scattered throughout the cirque.The mail carrier did more than simply delive","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-12T15:00:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183774215","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3133220-1840310314339425","game_id":"steam-3133220","kind":"announcement","title":"Discover MAFATE: A Cozy Adventure Inspired by the Heart of Réunion Island","summary":"In the heart of the Indian Ocean lies a truly unique place, shaped by nature, towering mountains, and the stories of the people who call it home: the Cirque of Mafate on Réunion Island.It is within this extraordinary setting that MAFATE was born, our cozy exploration game developed by Blue Ramen, an independent game studio from Réunion Island. Step Into the Shoes of an Unusual Mail Carrier In MAFATE, you play as Elios, a young mail carrier who travels the trails of this remote valley to deliver ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-05T15:00:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314339425","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3133220-1839676055883268","game_id":"steam-3133220","kind":"announcement","title":"Behind the Scenes of MAFATE","summary":"In Mafate, observing the world around you is an essential part of the experience. The fauna and flora are not just here to decorate the environment: they are part of the exploration and discovery of the world.Today, we are sharing a behind-the-scenes look at how we integrated the Zoiseau la Vierge into the game. Bringing a bird to lifeCreating an animal is not just about giving it a 3D model.Once the model is completed, we need to think about how it will move and exist within the world.For the Z","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-29T18:11:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055883268","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3133220-1830163047260952","game_id":"steam-3133220","kind":"announcement","title":"Nouvelle DEMO Alpha Disponible pour le Earth Appreciation Festival !","summary":"Salut la communauté MAFATE ! 👋 On revient avec une nouvelle qui nous tient vraiment à coeur 💚 : MAFATE participe à l'Earth Appreciation Festival & Showcase 2026 ! Un événement dédié aux jeux qui célèbrent notre belle planète... difficile de trouver meilleure scène pour un jeu sur le cirque de Mafate, non ? 🌿🏔️ Mais ce n'est pas tout. On a profité de l'occasion pour vous préparer quelque chose de grand : une toute nouvelle démo Alpha. 🎉 Oui, vous avez bien entendu ! On dit au revoir à la pré-alph","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-17T17:17:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047260952","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3133220-1826992588589269","game_id":"steam-3133220","kind":"announcement","title":"Relaxing Event 2026 !","summary":"🌿 The calendar is filling up for MAFATE! 🎉 Relaxing Event 2026 We're thrilled to announce that MAFATE is part of the Relaxing Event 2026 on Steam — starting tomorrow! You'll find us on page 2 under the \"Relaxing Jobs\" category. The event runs for 8 days, so it's the perfect time to discover cozy games — and maybe add a few to your wishlist. 👇 👉 Check out the Relaxing Event 2026 🎬 What's up with MAFATE? We've been heads-down working on something big. We are completely reworking our free demo to b","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-11T07:41:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826992588589269","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3133220-1816849002013008","game_id":"steam-3133220","kind":"announcement","title":"We're still here, cooking for U !","summary":"🌿 Update – Visual Improvements, Level Design Polish & New Features!Hello everyone! We’ve just released a new update for the MAFATE demo, bringing visual upgrades, gameplay polish, and a few much-requested features. Here’s what’s new:🎨 Visual ImprovementsNPC Visual Updates:EliosHawkinsAnatoleEnvironment:Reworked decals for a more natural and cohesive lookVisual touch-ups in Marla – Chunk 02 & Chunk 03🎮 Gameplay & ControlsInput Remapping: Controls have been fully adjusted for better handling.Updat","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-21T07:43:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1816849002013008","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3133220-1808061939351103","game_id":"steam-3133220","kind":"announcement","title":"Sans titre","summary":"🌴 \\ Fresh Update for MAFATE! 🌊Version 0.3.7 is now live — packed with fixes and improvements to make your adventure in the Cirque smoother than ever! If you haven’t tried it yet, the free demo is waiting for you! 🛠 What’s new & fixed: ✨ Added a brand new Options Menu for more control over your experience 📝 Fixed localization typos in EN, FR, and Kréol 🚫 Fixed softlock issues caused by tricky collisions 🌉 Fixed bridge & log bugs in the swamp 🌐 Fixed issues with the Language Switch option 📚 Fixed ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-08-14T20:48:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1808061939351103","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3133220-1807966710816591","game_id":"steam-3133220","kind":"update","title":"MAFATE - Update v0.3.6","summary":"MAFATE - Update v0.3.6 Hello everyone! 👋 We’ve just released a small but important update to the **Pre-alpha Demo**. This patch focuses on polishing visuals and fixing several gameplay issues reported by you. Thank you for your feedback — it’s helping us make MAFATE better every day! ❤️ --- ✨ Added Ambient Occlusion & Decals in Balanced Quality Settings Natacha’s kids’ drawings on Petunia Inn’s walls 🛠 Fixed Collision stuck on Petunia’s house Baby ducks falling into the void Collision issue on M","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-08-13T13:57:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1807966710816591","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3133220-1807966710805301","game_id":"steam-3133220","kind":"announcement","title":"📢 MAFATE - Pre-alpha Demo v0.3.4 is LIVE!